{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEED EGGS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eggman is hungry. Feed him eggs from your basket until he's full</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220800/extras/a92d9f58f82f6f130fc451a580e6a2d8.poster.avif?t=1740120624\" width=410 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220800/extras/a92d9f58f82f6f130fc451a580e6a2d8.webm?t=1740120624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1220800/extras/a92d9f58f82f6f130fc451a580e6a2d8.mp4?t=1740120624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when he's full? No one's gotten there before... Could it be you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eggman's cutting-edge gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag-and-drop eggs to feed Eggman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your eggs, don't run out! Eggman will keep count... but sometimes he gets greedy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more eggs when you run out... or don't... Choose your own path!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep feeding Eggman until he's full - how many will it take?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will Eggman do? That's for you to discover!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f598aa593a6639c4bc59a58b7138c683ee7f59bf.jpg","localized_name":"Dude, you ran out of eggs.","name":"Dude, you ran out of eggs.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1220800/f598aa593a6639c4bc59a58b7138c683ee7f59bf.jpg"},{"icon":"92d84ffb9391e48a929719317631a724a2f38488.jpg","localized_name":"No thanks!","name":"No thanks!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/